#Post-RPSBLAST Processing Utility

#Input data file:	stdin
#Output data file:	(stdout)
#Annotation data at:	data
#E-Value cutoff:	0.01
#Redundancy:	Standard
#Data requested:	Domain hits and site annotations
#Output format -- tab-delimited table
#Show superfamilies: YES
#DATA
#SESSION	<session-ordinal>	<program>	<database>	<score-matrix>	<evalue-threshold>
#QUERY	<query-id>	<seq-type>	<seq-length>	<definition-line>
#DOMAINS
#<session-ordinal>	<query-id[readingframe]>	<hit-type>	<PSSM-ID>	<from>	<to>	<E-Value>	<bitscore>	<accession>	<short-name>	<incomplete>	<superfamily PSSM-ID>
#more such lines......
#ENDDOMAINS
#SITES
#<session-ordinal>	<query-id[readingframe]>	<annot-type>	<title>	<residue(coordinates)>	<complete-size>	<mapped-size>	<source-domain>
#more such lines......
#ENDSITES
#MOTIFS
#<session-ordinal>	<query-id[readingframe]>	<title>	<from>	<to>	<source-domain>
#more such lines......
#ENDMOTIFS
#ENDQUERY	<query-id>
#more query sections..
#ENDSESSION	<session-ordinal>
#more session sections..
#ENDDATA
#=====================================================================
DATA
SESSION	1	tblastn	2.17.0+	rps_cdd	BLOSUM62	0.001
QUERY	Query_1	Nucleotide	600	stopq
DOMAINS
ENDDOMAINS
SUPERFAMILIES
ENDSUPERFAMILIES
ENDQUERY
QUERY	Query_2	Nucleotide	3	len3
DOMAINS
ENDDOMAINS
SUPERFAMILIES
ENDSUPERFAMILIES
ENDQUERY
QUERY	Query_3	Nucleotide	637	YP_009220476.1 bt strand=+ flank=0
DOMAINS
ENDDOMAINS
SUPERFAMILIES
ENDSUPERFAMILIES
ENDQUERY
QUERY	Query_4	Nucleotide	905	YP_009220478.1 bt strand=- flank=0
DOMAINS
ENDDOMAINS
SUPERFAMILIES
ENDSUPERFAMILIES
ENDQUERY
QUERY	Query_5	Nucleotide	600	lower
DOMAINS
1	Query_5[1]	Specific	177038	1	570	1.52455e-113	310.16	CHL00113	rps4	-	-
ENDDOMAINS
SUPERFAMILIES
ENDSUPERFAMILIES
ENDQUERY
ENDSESSION	1
ENDDATA
